      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sync\u0027d offline : we decided to have this listener only have one method : onComplete() with no arguments. Rationale :\n• There is no possible asynchronous error today\n• We don\u0027t foresee any asynchronous error in the future\n• If there is, then we\u0027ll extend this with onComplete(Exception) and deprecate the no-arg version",
