        "id": 1470463
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-07T05:53:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The thought here was to communicate all exceptions to the caller when possible over the listener. On l.9326 in this patch, that\u0027s only outside the try/catch since if the listener is null, there is nothing to communicate back to. That said, that code is removed in the latest patch since listener is now nullable. \n\nTo that end, I updated to catch exception however I am open to modifying if you think it makes sense.",
      "parentUuid": "d53b81ce_617f31aa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9335,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 9335,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "d5e8efc6efd8c2fc61d5fdbe0d63655e8887e79a",
